OL,3,GNEWSACaptain in UK's worst helicopter
OL,4,Acrash recalls 1986 tragedy
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow 85, Vaid believes he was just
OL,7,F"lucky" to escape: "I just could not
OL,8,Fgrasp how 45 people couldn't make it,
OL,9,Fand two of us were able to come out of
OL,10,Fit," he said.
